-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",51,{
[1601]="7006EEE0\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi to begin the assault\tSpeak with Mizâdi to begin the assault.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma in Khûd Zagin.\n",
[1602]="7006C4B2\n1\tSpeak with Galâmka when you are ready to begin\tThe preparations are complete and Galâmka is ready to begin the battle to retake Maurûsh.\n2\tSpeak with Galâmka\tSpeak with Galâmka about the battle.\n",
[1603]="70027A66\n1\tRescue injured Rohirrim (0/4)\tWounded Rohirrim warriors lie atop Dol Baran, beyond the Rohirrim encampment. Captain Féarn has asked you to rescue injured Rohirrim warriors atop Dol Baran.\n2\tRescue injured Rohirrim (1/4)\tWounded Rohirrim warriors lie atop Dol Baran, beyond the Rohirrim encampment. Captain Féarn has asked you to rescue injured Rohirrim warriors atop Dol Baran.\n3\tRescue injured Rohirrim (2/4)\tWounded Rohirrim warriors lie atop Dol Baran, beyond the Rohirrim encampment. Captain Féarn has asked you to rescue injured Rohirrim warriors atop Dol Baran.\n4\tRescue injured Rohirrim (3/4)\tWounded Rohirrim warriors lie atop Dol Baran, beyond the Rohirrim encampment. Captain Féarn has asked you to rescue injured Rohirrim warriors atop Dol Baran.\n5\tTalk to Captain Féarn atop Dol Baran\tCaptain Féarn can be found atop Dol Baran. You should return to Captain Féarn with tidings of your victory.\n",
[1604]="70027A65\n1\tDouse burning fortifications (total: 5)\tDunlendings are assaulting the barricades atop Dol Baran. Captain Féarn has asked you to defeat the Dunlending warriors by the barricades atop Dol Baran.\n2\tTalk to Captain Féarn atop Dol Baran\tCaptain Féarn is atop Dol Baran. You should inform Captain Féarn of your victory.\n",
[1605]="70027A64\n1\tDefeat Dunlending warriors (total: 12)\tDunlending warriors can be found near the barricades atop Dol Baran. Grimbold has asked you to defeat Dunlending warriors by the barricades atop Dol Baran.\n2\tTalk to Captain Féarn\tCaptain Féarn awaits your return atop Dol Baran. You should bring Captain Féarn news of your success.\n",
[1606]="70029FC8\n1\tComplete 'Battle of the Deep-way' in a raid group\tThe Deep-way, a passage connecting the Great Delving to the Water-works, must be defended against the Orc onslaught.\n",
[1607]="70024CDD\n1\tEnter the snowball battle-field\tThe snowball battle-field is in the field below Winter-home. You should begin by entering the battle-field. WARNING: You can only participate in the snowball-fight inside the boundaries of the field. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tWait for the snow-battle event to begin\tYou should wait for the fight to begin while waiting inside the battle-field's bounds.\n3\tGather snowballs and attack your fellow players (total: 10)\030(Right-click the snowballs you gather to attack selected targets.)\tSnowballs can be made from the piles of snow around the battle-field. They appear in your inventory and are destroyed when you throw them at another player. You should gather snowballs and attack your competitors.\n",
[1608]="700250DF\n1\tEnter the snowball battle-field\tThe snowball battle-field is in the field below Winter-home. You should begin by entering the battle-field. WARNING: You can only participate in the snowball-fight inside the boundaries of the field. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tWait for the snow-battle event to begin\tYou should wait for the fight to begin while waiting inside the battle-field's bounds. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tGather snowballs and attack your fellow players (total: 15)\030(Right-click the snowballs you gather to attack selected targets.)\tSnowballs can be made from the piles of snow around the battle-field. You should gather snowballs and attack your competitors. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[1609]="7003B51F\n1\tComplete Battle of the Snowballs (Easy)\030Complete Battle of the Snowballs (Hard)\tParticipate in the Snowball-fight!\n2\tTalk to Cecil Voller\tCecil Voller awaits you at the edge of the battle-field. You should speak with Cecil Voller of your success in the snowball battle.\n",
[1610]="70024A9B\n1\tWait for Wíli to finish relaying his orders to his men.\t\n2\tTalk to Wíli in the Twenty-first Hall\tSpeak with Wíli to see what aid you might lend in his defence.\n3\tPush back the first assault\tThe first assault on the Twenty-first Hall has begun. Defend the eastern bulwark!\n4\tTalk to Wíli in the Twenty-first Hall\tWíli is at the centre of the Twenty-first Hall. You should return to Wíli for further instruction.\n5\tPush back the second assault\tThe second assault on the Twenty-first Hall has begun. Defend the southern bulwark!\n6\tTalk to Wíli in the Twenty-first Hall\tWíli is at the centre of the Twenty-first Hall. You should return to Wíli for further instructions.\n7\tPush back the third assault\tThe third assault on the Twenty-first Hall has begun. Defend the western bulwark!\n8\tTalk to Wíli in the Twenty-first Hall\tWíli is at the centre of the Twenty-first Hall. You should return to Wíli for further instruction.\n9\tTalk to Wíli in the Chamber of Mazarbul\tWíli is in the Chamber of Mazarbul, east off the Northern Hallway. You should speak with Wíli and prepare for the final assaults.\n10\tPush back the fourth assault\tThe fourth assault on the Twenty-first Hall has begun. Defend the Northern Hallway!\n11\tTalk to Wíli in the Chamber of Mazarbul\tWíli is in the Chamber of Mazarbul, east of the Northern Hallway. The dwarves were forced to retreat back to the Chamber of Mazarbul. You should join Wíli and prepare for the final assault.\n12\tPush back the final assault and defeat the commander of the Orcs\tThe final assault on the Twenty-first Hall has begun. Defend the Chamber of Mazarbul!\n13\tTalk to Wíli in the Chamber of Mazarbul\tWíli is in the Chamber of Mazarbul, east of the Northern Hallway. You should return to Wíli to discuss your success against the Orcs of Mazog.\n",
[1611]="70029FCA\n1\tComplete 'Battle of the Twenty-first Hall' in a raid group\tYou have travelled to the Twenty-first Hall to aid in its defence. Follow Wíli's direction and help the Dwarves of Moria make their stand!\n",
[1612]="70029FC9\n1\tComplete 'Battle of the Way of Smiths' in a raid group\tThe Way of Smiths, in which lies the secret entrance to the Heart of Fire, must be defended from the Ghâsh-hai loyal to Mazog.\n",
[1613]="7000E83F\n1\tDefeat Trév Duvárdain in western Angmar (total: 15)\tThe Hillmen of the Trév Duvárdain can be throughout western Angmar, far to the north of Esteldín. Handarod has asked you to defeat the Trév Duvárdain in western Angmar.\n2\tTalk to Handarod\tHandarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the south of Angmar. You should return to Handarod and tell him of your battles against the Trév Duvárdain.\n",
[1614]="70068B62\n1\tRecover stolen baubles from enemies in the Gut (total: 8)\tStolen baubles can be recovered from enemies in the Gut, located in the Lower Ward.\n2\tBring stolen baubles to Ikha in the Lower Ward\tIkha is in the Lower Ward.\n",
[1615]="700542E3\n1\tBurn vile totems at Baur Kasak\tVile totems can be found at Baur Kasak in Arandor. You should burn vile totems at Baur Kasak.\n2\tBurn vile totems at Baur Kasak (total: 8)\tVile totems can be found at Baur Kasak in Arandor. You should burn vile totems at Baur Kasak.\n3\tCompleted\tBurned vile totems at Baur Kasak.\n",
[1616]="700542E2\n1\tBurn slop piles at Baur Kasak\tSlop piles can be found at Baur Kasak in Arandor. You should burn slop piles at Baur Kasak.\n2\tBurn slop piles at Baur Kasak (total: 12)\tSlop piles can be found at Baur Kasak in Arandor. You should burn slop piles at Baur Kasak.\n3\tCompleted\tBurned slop piles at Baur Kasak.\n",
[1617]="7005CAB2\n1\tCollect plant samples (total: 3)\tThe foetid fountain pools are located near Bazanmanar. Golodhril has asked you to bring her samples of the plants from the foetid pools.\n2\tReturn to Golodhril\tGolodhril is located in Bazanmanar. You should bring the plant samples to Golodhril.\n3\tCollect clay from Kurdushâlak\tKurdushâlak runs the length of Clovengap. Golodhril has asked you to collect clay from the banks of Kurdushâlak.\n4\tBring the clay to Golodhril\tGolodhril is located in Bazanmanar. You should bring the clay to Golodhril.\n5\tMix the clay in the mortar\tGolodhril's workbench is located in Bazanmanar. You should mix the clay with the ingredients in the mortar on Golodhril's workbench.\n6\tTreat foetid pools (total: 8)\tThe foetid pools are located near Bazanmanar. Golodhril has asked you to add drops of the antidote to the foetid pools.\n7\tReturn to Golodhril\tGolodhril is located in Bazanmanar. You should give Golodhril the good news.\n",
[1618]="7000EAB0\n1\tCollect banner scraps (total: 5)\030Collect coal (total: 5)\030Collect leg pieces (total: 5)\tThe Kantâ-vilkku is east and a little south of Sûri-kylä along the snow drifts that look over the ice bay of Forochel. Matti has asked that you go to the Kantâ-vilkku and use the parts found there to repair it.\n2\tRepair the Kantâ-vilkku\030Collect Snow-beacon Banner Scrap (total: 5)\030Collect Snow-beacon Coal (total: 5)\030Collect Snow-beacon Leg Piece (total: 5)\tThe Kantâ-vilkku is east and a little south of Sûri-kylä along the snow drifts that look over the ice bay of Forochel. Matti has asked that you visit the Kantâ-vilkku and repair it.\n3\tTalk to Matti\tMatti is at Sûri-kylä, west and a little north from the Kantâ-vilkku. You should return to Matti and tell him of your success.\n",
[1619]="70017588\n1\tCollect lore-fragments (total: 12)\tLore-fragments can be found throughout the Water-works. Winiel has asked you to search for lore-fragments of the ancient dwarves.\n2\tTake the lore-fragments back to Winiel\tWiniel is at the Rotting Cellar in the Water-works. You should bring the lore-fragments back to Winiel.\n",
[1620]="7000AE1F\n1\tUse Grimwood kindling to light a signal-fire on the eastern shore of the Hoarwell near Tol Ascarnen\tThe beacon-fire must be built on the far shore of the Hoarwell. Sergeant-at-Arms Inuelen directed you to cross to the eastern shore of the Hoarwell, and there light a signal-fire to summon a force to assail Tol Ascarnen.\n",
[1621]="70058732\n1\tPlace traps on the battlefield (quantity: see journal)\tGood places to place traps can be found around the battlefield. You should place traps around the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tPlaced many traps on the battlefield.\n",
[1622]="70060969\n1\tFind food for Onora and Rúdhan (total: 4)\tOnora has asked you to investigate the rocks to the north-west in search of food to forage.\n2\tCollect some meat from the fresh bear carcass\tA fresh bear carcass could supply plenty of food for Onora and Rúdhan during their recovery.\n3\tBring the food you collected back to Onora and Rúdhan\tHead back to Onora and tell her about the shelter.\n",
[1623]="70007D61\n1\tBring the perfect bear-hide to an Elf armourer in Rivendell\tAn armourer of sufficient skill likely dwells in the hidden valley of Rivendell, far to the east of the Bruinen Gorges, across the Ford of Bruinen and beyond. It will take an armourer of great skill to craft armour worthy of the beast from which this perfect hide came.\n",
[1624]="70001889\n1\tReturn the bear-meat to Hornbori\030Gather bear-meat (total: 6)\tBears live in the hills south of Othrikar. To help allay Othrikar's supply shortage, Hornbori has asked you to hunt bears for their meat.\n",
[1625]="70027202\n1\tTalk to Gwilum in Barnavon\tGwilum stands outside the gate to Barnavon-town, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine. Cada asked you to bring word of Yago's and Matho's deaths to Gwilum.\n",
[1626]="70033063\n1\tBring the message to Hysing in Anazârmekhem\tAnazârmekhem can be found north of Hadâd-mezer in the Flaming Deeps. You should deliver the slain dwarf's message warning of the formidable Ghâsh-hai to Anazârmekhem.\n",
[1627]="70058512\n1\tDefeat Iron Crown scouts (total: 4)\tRékkur has asked you to defeat Iron Crown scouts on the outskirts of Annâk-khurfu and find out what they're searching for. A couple may be lurking behind Annâk-khurfu, while others watch the path leading up to it.\n2\tTalk to Rékkur\tRékkur is waiting for you at Annâk-khurfu. He will want to hear about the Angmarim orders you found.\n",
[1628]="7004E8DE\n1\tCollect honey from beehives (total: 8)\tYou should collect honey to present to the Beornings as a gift.\n2\tSeek Threkmóth in Skoghús\tYou should travel due south of Radagast, in Thornholt, to Skoghús, the Beorning camp.\n3\tTalk to Threkmóth\tThrekmóth can be found in Skoghús, deep in the Thornholt woods. You should introduce yourself to Threkmóth, the leader of the Beorning settlement, and deliver your gift to him.\n4\tTalk to Vaskorn\tYou should go speak with Vaskorn, who can be found in Threkmóth, deep in the Thornholt woods.\n",
[1629]="70067F50\n1\tGain Tankho's pledge\030Gain Kharishah's pledge\030Gain Beliash's pledge\030Gain Hûzo's pledge\tAyaluk says that he collected written requests from the different masters in the fort. He asked that you get their verbal agreement that they submitted these reports and requests and come back to him.\n2\tReturn to Ayaluk at his family home in Rakhatâb\tYou have gained the pledge of all the masters that they will bear witness to filing these reports. It is time to return to Ayaluk.\n3\tSpeak with Foreman Nûrut in Rakhatâb\tTake the evidence supplied to you and deliver it to Foreman Nûrut in Rakhatâb.\n",
[1630]="7005298A\n1\tComplete 'The Best Butter'\030Complete 'Exceptional Eggs'\030Complete 'Joyous Jam'\tGírta has three tasks that need doing near and around the Beorninghús. You should make jam, butter, and gather eggs for Gírta.\n2\tTalk to Gírta\tGírta can be found at the Beorninghús. You should talk to Gírta.\n",
[1631]="7002CA8A\n1\tComplete 'The Lost Message'\030Complete 'A Threat Unseen'\tCabed has sent you to complete two tasks before he reveals what he knows about a hidden threat in Parth Celebrant. Cabed is located along the southern road of Parth Celebrant.\n2\tTalk to Cabed\tCabed is located along the southern road of Parth Celebrant. You should return to Cabed with news of your success.\n",
[1632]="7001B229\n1\tDefeat bears in the Northern Bree-fields (total: 12)\tBears can be found throughout the north Bree-fields. Ray Thistlebur has asked you to thin the number of the bears in the area.\n2\tReturn to Ray Thistlebur at Thornley's work-site\tRay Thistlebur awaits your return at the stables at Thornley's work-site. He will be pleased to know that you have done as he asked.\n",
})
